><mn>0</mn></msub></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\qquad\qquad+x^{-1}\sum_{\begin{subarray}{c}G_{0}\in\mathcal{L}(\mathsf{M}\smallsetminus i)\\
