<p id="S3.SS2.p5.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS2.p5.6.1" class="ltx_text">Note that the two sums appearing in the last equation are equal. Furthermore, they agree with the definition of <math id="S3.SS2.p5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\upzeta_{\mathsf{M}\smallsetminus i}^{F_{0}}=\upzeta_{\mathsf{M}\smallsetminus i}^{F\smallsetminus i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext class="undefined">\upzeta</mtext><mrow><mi>𝖬</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mtext class="undefined">\upzeta</mtext><mrow><mi>𝖬</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\upzeta_{\mathsf{M}\smallsetminus i}^{F_{0}}=\upzeta_{\mathsf{M}\smallsetminus i}^{F\smallsetminus i}</annotation></semantics></math>. This completes the proof.
