<p id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">In particular, if <math id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{M}</annotation></semantics></math> arises from a partition <math id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uplambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtext class="undefined">\uplambda</mtext><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uplambda</annotation></semantics></math> of <math id="S5.Thmtheorem2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[n]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[n]</annotation></semantics></math>, then</span></p>
