<p id="S5.p9.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.p9.5.1" class="ltx_text">According to SageMath, this polynomial is not real-rooted. It possesses two complex conjugate zeros near <math id="S5.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-1.0297\pm 0.1097\,i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1.0297</mn></mrow><mo>±</mo><mrow><mn>0.1097</mn><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-1.0297\pm 0.1097\,i</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
