<div id="S5.Thmtheorem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_remark">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S5.Thmtheorem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Remark 5.4</span></span></h6>
<div id="S5.Thmtheorem4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.Thmtheorem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We were unable to find counterexamples for the logarithmic concavity of <math id="S5.Thmtheorem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{\mathsf{M}}(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>𝖬</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{\mathsf{M}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S5.Thmtheorem4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y_{\mathsf{M}}(x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>𝖬</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y_{\mathsf{M}}(x)</annotation></semantics></math> using matroids of the form described above. We have verified with the help of a computer that Conjecture <a href="#S1.Thmtheorem2" title="Conjecture 1.2 ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ Inverse Kazhdan–Lusztig polynomialsof matroids under deletion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1.2</span></a> (<a href="#S1.I2.i3" title="Item c ‣ Conjecture 1.2 ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ Inverse Kazhdan–Lusztig polynomialsof matroids under deletion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">c</span></a>) and (<a href="#S1.I2.i4" title="Item d ‣ Conjecture 1.2 ‣ 1. Introduction ‣ Inverse Kazhdan–Lusztig polynomialsof matroids under deletion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">d</span></a>) hold for all corank <math id="S5.Thmtheorem4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>2</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2</annotation></semantics></math> matroids of cardinality less than or equal to <math id="S5.Thmtheorem4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="35" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>35</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">35</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
